    "detailed_description": "What if there was a world where monsters existed, but first they needed to be created in a factory before they could be shipped off to scare people?<br>Welcome to Monster Shopper, where <strong><i>you</i></strong> will be taking care of that production cycle.<br><br>Each client will want their own type of monster. Assemble the correct body parts, and give them the right color. With more and more clients wanting their own monster; get ready to make complex factories.<br>How long can you keep your factory in business?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Factory Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Conveyor belts<br></li><li> Body part spawner<br></li><li> Body part combiner<br></li><li> Dyer<br></li><li> Splitter<br></li><li> Underground conveyor belts</li></ul><br>Don't forget to wishlist Monster Shopper to help with development, and get notified when the game releases!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266150/extras/ea78781fbc0ef110e93702c5a1ef72fd.poster.avif?t=1677596002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266150/extras/ea78781fbc0ef110e93702c5a1ef72fd.webm?t=1677596002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
